# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build trees. All three are produced by the verification gate:
#     ./scripts/dev.sh ./scripts/check.sh
# which configures and builds build-none (-O2), build-address (ASan+UBSan)
# and build-thread (TSan), then runs every suite in each.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
compile_commands.json

# Compiled output
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
*.gcda
*.gcno

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch space and generated databases. Tests and benchmarks write their
# database directories under $LSMENG_TEST_DIR (default /data inside the
# container), never into the source tree; scratch/ is the local escape hatch.
# Regenerate benchmark data with, e.g.:
#     ./build-none/bench --bench fillrandom --num 40000 --db /data/ws
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
*.sst
*.log
MANIFEST-*
CURRENT
LOCK

# Profiler and valgrind output. Regenerate with:
#     perf record -e cpu-clock ./build-none/bench ...
#     valgrind --tool=massif ./build-none/bench ...
perf.data*
callgrind.out.*
cachegrind.out.*
massif.out.*

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Working notes, not part of the project
context3.md
